---
import Legal from "../../layouts/Legal.astro";
import { config } from "../../config";
---
<Legal title="Cookie notice" description="BuddyAI's website uses no tracking cookies (DRAFT, needs legal review).">
  <p><strong>This website uses no tracking cookies</strong>, so there is no cookie banner.</p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    {config.plausibleDomain
      ? "We use Plausible Analytics, a cookieless analytics service. It counts page views in aggregate without cookies and without building personal profiles or tracking you across websites."
      : "We don't currently use analytics on this website. If we add analytics, it will be cookieless (for example Plausible) and we will update this notice."}
  </p>

  <h2>Local storage</h2>
  <p>
    If you choose a currency (£ or €), your browser remembers that choice in local storage on your device. It is not
    sent to us and is not used for tracking. You can clear it at any time in your browser settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Checkout</h2>
  <p>
    When you click "Buy now" you are taken to Stripe's checkout page, which uses cookies that are strictly necessary for
    secure payment and fraud prevention. See Stripe's own cookie policy for details.
  </p>

  <h2>The BuddyAI app</h2>
  <p>
    The customer web app (where you sign in) uses a strictly necessary session cookie to keep you logged in.
    {/* TODO(owner): confirm the app's cookies. */}
  </p>
</Legal>
